'''Living in Love''' (愛に生きる者, ''Ai ni Ikiru Mono'', '''Those With a Life of Love''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]].

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Power UP (Sm): Cat Cannon attack power increases by 20%.

